sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W as publish.yml
  participant T as tlog.py
  participant CO as cosign
  participant SE as seal.py
  W->>T: evento release.approved
  W->>T: checkpoint (origen, tamaño, raíz)
  W->>CO: sign-blob del checkpoint
  CO-->>W: checkpoint.sigstore.json
  W->>T: verify (todos los checkpoints, consistencia, firmas)
  W->>SE: escribir manifest.json (rules_root y cabeza del registro)
  W->>CO: sign-blob de manifest.json
  CO-->>W: manifest.sigstore.json
  W->>T: release-proof (prueba de inclusión de la entrada candidate.accepted)
  T-->>W: inclusion-proof.json
